    "body": "Appendix B doesn't list `multi_a()` and `sortedmulti_a()`, which BIP 387 defines as script expressions. The first commit adds both rows, in the same form the table already uses for `multi()` and `sortedmulti()`.\n\nIn Appendix A, the Annotation row links to `bip-descriptorannotations.mediawiki`, which doesn't exist, and shows \"?\" where the BIP number goes. BIP 393 was merged as `bip-0393.mediawiki`, and the second commit points the row there.\n\nThe third commit fixes typos and grammar. It also writes the hardened wildcard as `/*h`, like the rest of the Key Expressions section, and changes `<super>` to `<sup>`, because GitHub shows `<super>` as plain text.\n",
